WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.580
Scams. Forms. Popups. The web can feel like this.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:11.120
Meet Tusk. A little elephant in the corner of the page.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.500
No new app. No account. Just help, right where you are.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.500
When a banner blocks the page, Tusk points to the safe choice.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.730
Stuck? Ask in your own words. Tusk shows you the next step.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:34.120
And when an email is not what it seems, Tusk warns you.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.000
Forms, field by field. Plain words. One clear step.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.800
In the language you think in. English. German. Spanish.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.100
No passwords. Scam warnings. It asks first.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.250
No Little Tusk cloud. No account. Bring your own AI key.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:01.770
Set it up for someone you love. One link. Guardrails included.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.580
Little Tusk. A little help, right on the page.
